  "description": "Dong-Baek’s life takes an unexpected turn when a mysterious crow pulls her from the modern world into ancient China. Trapped in the Three Kingdoms era, she must disguise herself as a man and gather allies from each kingdom in order to survive. Amid heavy political intrigue, she also faces a rival determined to defeat her. Can Dong-Baek outsmart this enemy and navigate the dangerous world she now inhabits?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
